	(text "Assembly notes (both factories, Lesson 10):\nD2: any SMDJ45A, one-way (no C), SMC; cathode to VBAT.\nD8: a 43 V 2 % zener only (BZT52B43): it sets the trip (D-03).\nD12: WS2812B or XL-5050RGBC-2812B: pin 1 VDD, chamfer at pin 3.\nSRV05-4 (U9-U13, U15-U17): same pinout only, VCC pin 5.\nR28, R29: 0805. U7: Tokmas ICM-42688-P (D-09)."
